<p>Dear Clinical Research Team,</p>

<p>Philips Healthcare has completed the technical pre-assessment of your <b>Vigilyx Gateway Healthcare Edition</b> for integration with Philips patient monitoring systems (IntelliVue, Amber). To achieve full <b>HL7 FHIR R4</b> and <b>IHE ITI-TF</b> certification, a clinical safety review of your email filtering algorithm is required by the <b>Philips Clinical Engineering Board</b>.</p>

<h3>一、Certification Details</h3>
